                  "stats": {
                    "level": {
                      "value": 1
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "You can access the basic Cryptarch archives and can decode engrams at no cost. For whatever you don't know, you know how to contact someone who does know, be they in your own department or not. You can also borrow basic, unrestricted equipment from your department of study for predetermined lengths of time."
